    {
      "@type": "Review",
      "reviewAspect": "join",
      "reviewBody": "State‑level income and payroll taxes are not directly observed in the HRS. The authors estimate each respondent’s taxes by feeding demographic and income variables from HRS into the NBER TAXSIM tax‑simulation model and then attach the simulated tax amounts back to the HRS record.",
