        "joinType": "integration",
        "joinKeys": "[\"respondent_id\"]",
        "methodology": "The researchers extracted demographic and income variables from the Health and Retirement Study, reshaped them to meet the input format required by the NBER TAXSIM tax simulation model, executed the model for each respondent to generate state level tax estimates, averaged the tax amounts across all "
      },
      "reviewRating": [
