        "methodology": "The authors first extracted annual poverty and food insecurity rates from the CPS public tables. Then they computed comparable rates from the HRS by aggregating respondents by survey year and age group. The two datasets were aligned on the calendar year and age group variables and merged as a simple"
      },
      "reviewRating": [
        {
          "@type": "Rating",
          "name": "join_confidence",
          "ratingValue": 7.3
        }
