        "methodology": "The authors used the HRS data set that already contains the official poverty measure (OPM) variable and the required income components. To determine OPM‑poor status they applied the Census Bureau OPM poverty thresholds to each respondent. For each record they derived a household unit identifier base"
      },
      "reviewRating": [
        {
          "@type": "Rating",
          "name": "join_confidence",
          "ratingValue": 7.0
        }
